	(516, 21, 32, NULL, 'Tools, APIs & Middleware Integration', '{"Coverage": "Memory, tool orchestration, and agent chaining\nConnecting agents to APIs, databases, and external tools\nMiddleware components: Redis, FastAPI, event queues\nClaude tool usage patterns; orchestration via APIs and middleware;\nComparison with function calling approaches", "Daily Topic": "Tools, APIs & Middleware Integration", "Focus of the week": "Week 4: Generative AI and Agentic AI Systems Continued and Agentic AI System"}'),
